          child: Text('移动', style: textStyle),
        ),
      ],
      child: AppBar(
        title: const Text('稍后再看'),
        actions: [
          IconButton(
            tooltip: '搜索',
            onPressed: () {
              final mid = Accounts.main.mid;
              Get.toNamed(
                '/laterSearch',
